al display, modal closing\"\n    status: pending\n---\n\n# Cursor Mental Models Dictionary - Implementation Plan\n\n## Architecture Overview\n\nA static single-page application that dynamically loads mental model data from JSON and renders an interactive card grid with search and modal detail views.\n\n### Data Flow\n\n```text\nmental-models.json → app.js (fetch) → renderCards() → DOM\n                                    → filterCards() → renderCards()\n                                    → openModal() → renderModal()\n```\n\n### File Responsibilities\n\n- **`index.html`**: Base HTML structure with semantic elements (header, search input, cards container, modal overlay)\n- **`styles.css`**: Complete styling system (layout, cards, modal, colors, typography)\n- **`app.js`**: All JavaScript logic (data loading, rendering, search filtering, modal management)\n- **`data/mental-models.json`**: Single source of truth for all mental model content\n- **`README.md`**: Project documentation explaining purpose and usage\n\n## Implementation Details\n\n### HTML Structure (`index.html`)\n\n- Semantic HTML5 structure\n- Header section with title and subtitle\n- Search input with placeholder text\n- Grid container for cards (initially empty, populated by JS)\n- Modal overlay (hidden by default) with:\n  - Close button\n  - Title\n  - Detailed explanation list\n  - Related features section\n  - Documentation links section\n\n### CSS Architecture (`styles.css`)\n\n- CSS custom properties for colors (design system)\n- Base typography and reset styles\n- Header and search bar layout\n- Responsive grid layout for cards (CSS Grid)\n- Card styling (white background, rounded corners, shadow, hover effects)\n- Feature tag styling (light blue background)\n- Modal overlay (full-screen backdrop, centered content box)\n- Modal content layout (scrollable if needed)\n- Responsive breakpoints for mobile/tablet\n\n### JavaScript Logic (`app.js`)\n\n**State Management:**\n\n- `mentalModels` array (l